# Directory Structure

VeChain Block Explorer frontend - Next.js 15 App Router project.

## Root Structure

```
block-explorer/
├── app/                    # Next.js App Router pages
├── components/             # Shared React components
├── hooks/                  # Custom React hooks
├── i18n/                   # Internationalization
├── lib/                    # Core utilities, schemas, stores
├── services/               # API clients and data fetching
├── public/                 # Static assets
├── test/                   # Test setup
├── terraform/              # Infrastructure as code
├── middleware.ts           # Next.js middleware (locale routing)
├── env.api.ts              # Server-side env vars
├── env.public.ts           # Client-side env vars
└── next.config.ts
```

## App Directory (`app/`)

Locale-prefixed routes under `app/[locale]/`:

```
app/
├── [locale]/
│   ├── page.tsx                    # Homepage
│   ├── layout.tsx                  # Root layout with providers
│   ├── address/[address]/          # Address/account pages
│   ├── block/[blockId]/            # Block detail pages
│   ├── transaction/[transactionId]/ # Transaction detail pages
│   └── components/                 # Page-specific components
│       ├── ActivitySection.tsx
│       ├── BlocksTable.tsx
│       ├── BlockUsage/
│       ├── PriceCards.tsx
│       └── TransactionsTable.tsx
└── api/                            # API routes
    ├── b32/                        # B32 name resolution
    └── nft-metadata/               # NFT metadata proxy
```

## Components (`components/`)

```
components/
├── ui/                 # Preferred UI primitives (use these)
│   ├── Card.tsx
│   ├── Table.tsx
│   ├── Links.tsx
│   ├── Balance.tsx
│   ├── StatusBadge.tsx
│   └── ...
├── ui-legacy/          # Legacy components (avoid expanding)
├── theme/              # Chakra theme configuration
│   ├── config.tsx
│   ├── provider.tsx
│   └── text-styles.ts
├── navigation/         # Header, search, network select
├── Footer/
└── error/              # Error boundary and not-found
```

## Services (`services/`)

API clients for external data sources:

```
services/
├── thor/               # VeChain Thor node client
│   ├── client.ts       # Base client setup
│   ├── account.ts      # Account queries
│   ├── block.ts        # Block queries
│   ├── transaction.ts  # Transaction queries
│   ├── hooks.ts        # React Query hooks
│   ├── vns.ts          # VeChain Name Service
│   └── tokens/         # ERC20/ERC721 helpers
├── veworld-indexer/    # VeWorld Indexer API
│   ├── index.ts        # Client setup
│   ├── hooks.ts        # React Query hooks
│   ├── schemas.ts      # Zod validation schemas
│   ├── transactions.ts
│   ├── transfers.ts
│   └── ...
├── coin-api/           # Price data
│   ├── hooks.ts
│   └── price-list.ts
├── b32.ts              # B32 name service
└── nft-metadata.ts     # NFT metadata fetching
```

## Lib (`lib/`)

Core utilities and infrastructure:

```
lib/
├── api/                # Fetch helpers
├── constants/          # Network configs, contract addresses
├── query-client/       # TanStack Query provider
├── schemas/            # Zod schemas for API responses
│   ├── account.ts
│   ├── blocks.ts
│   ├── transactions.ts
│   └── events.ts
├── stores/
│   └── settings.ts     # Zustand settings store (network, currency)
├── utils/              # Pure utility functions
│   ├── address.ts
│   ├── date.ts
│   ├── units.ts
│   └── vns.ts
└── type-predicates.ts
```

## i18n (`i18n/`)

```
i18n/
├── config.ts           # Supported locales
├── languages/          # Translation JSON files (en.json, etc.)
├── provider.tsx        # Client-side provider
├── server.ts           # Server-side translations
└── utils.ts
```

## Key Configuration Files

| File               | Purpose                   |
| ------------------ | ------------------------- |
| `next.config.ts`   | Next.js configuration     |
| `middleware.ts`    | Locale routing middleware |
| `tsconfig.json`    | TypeScript config         |
| `vitest.config.ts` | Test runner config        |
| `package.json`     | Dependencies and scripts  |

## Important Patterns

1. **Route params**: Dynamic segments use `[param]` naming (e.g., `[address]`, `[blockId]`)
2. **Service hooks**: Data fetching via `services/**/hooks.ts` files with TanStack Query
3. **Schemas**: Validate external data with `lib/schemas/**` and `services/**/schemas.ts`
4. **Settings store**: Network/currency from `lib/stores/settings.ts`
5. **UI components**: Prefer `components/ui/*` over `components/ui-legacy/*`
